      "MAXIMUM POWER OUTPUT",
      "In many electronic circuits and systems it is important to have maximum transfer of power from the source to the load. For example, in radio or TV transmitting systems, it is desired to transfer the maximum power possible from the transmitting medium to the antenna systems. We want maximum power transfer from amplifier to speaker system. This is accomplished by proper matching of load resistance R and source resistance r.",
