      "14.3 LENZ'S LAW",
      "Lenz's law is a convenient alternative method for determining the direction of an induced e.m.f or current. To demonstrate the lenz's law consider the South -pole of the magnet towards the coil as shown in figure 14.3 (a).",
      "As the south pole of the magnet moves toward the coil, the flux through the coil increases.",
