      "CLASSIFICATION OF MAGNETIC MATERIALS",
      "We can classify materials into three categories f.e, diamagnetic, paramagnetic and ferromagnetic. The behaviour of these three classes of substances is different in an external magnetic field.",
      "PARAMAGNETIC MATERIAL",
      "In these substances the orbital and spin axis of the electrons in an atom are so oriented",
