        "originalText": "Editorial clarification: The printed solution states “Total watts for lamps = 40×6 = 240 watts”, but its daily-energy calculation uses 250×4 for the lamps. The source values conflict; both printed lines are preserved without substituting one for the other.",
        "originalLanguage": "en"
