        "text": "Emf of the cell \\(\\epsilon_1=1.0183\\text{ V}\\); \\(l_1=1.0183\\text{ m}\\); \\(l_2=150\\text{ cm}=1.5\\text{ m}\\); resistance \\(R=0.1\\,\\Omega\\)",
        "english": "Emf of the cell \\(\\epsilon_1=1.0183\\text{ V}\\); \\(l_1=1.0183\\text{ m}\\); \\(l_2=150\\text{ cm}=1.5\\text{ m}\\); resistance \\(R=0.1\\,\\Omega\\)",
        "urdu": "سیل کی محرکہ قوت \\(\\epsilon_1=1.0183\\text{ V}\\)؛ \\(l_1=1.0183\\text{ m}\\)؛ \\(l_2=150\\text{ cm}=1.5\\text{ m}\\)؛ مزاحمت \\(R=0.1\\,\\Omega\\)",
        "pashto": "د حجرې محرکه قوه \\(\\epsilon_1=1.0183\\text{ V}\\)؛ \\(l_1=1.0183\\text{ m}\\)؛ \\(l_2=150\\text{ cm}=1.5\\text{ m}\\)؛ مقاومت \\(R=0.1\\,\\Omega\\)",
        "originalText": "Emf of the cell \\(\\epsilon_1=1.0183\\text{ V}\\); \\(l_1=1.0183\\text{ m}\\); \\(l_2=150\\text{ cm}=1.5\\text{ m}\\); resistance \\(R=0.1\\,\\Omega\\)",
