    "kind": "lesson",
    "content": "<p>Let n be the number of turns per unit length (n = N/l); we can write the equation as</p><p>B = μ₀ n I ...(13.5)</p><p>Equation 13.5 can be used to determine the magnetic field of a solenoid.</p>",
    "theory": "Let n be the number of turns per unit length (n = N/l); we can write the equation as\nB = μ₀ n I ...(13.5)\nEquation 13.5 can be used to determine the magnetic field of a solenoid.",
