    "title": "Velocity selector — introduction and Figure 13.21",
    "kind": "lesson",
    "content": "<p>E. VELOCITY SELECTOR</p><p>The device which allow only the particles with certain specific speed through it (thus permitting particles only with selected speeds) is called velocity selector.</p><p>FIGURE 13.21 — Velocity selector.</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 370\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Figure 13.21: electric and magnetic forces balance so selected-speed particles pass undeflected through a velocity selector.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:720px;height:auto\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"32\" width=\"680\" height=\"290\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"140\" width=\"54\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#facc15\" stroke=\"#a16207\"/><path d=\"M164 158H630\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 6\"/><path d=\"M245 90H525M245 225H525\" stroke=\"#be185d\" stroke-width=\"14\"/><g fill=\"#fff\"><text x=\"275\" y=\"96\">+</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"232\">−</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"96\">+</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"232\">−</text><text x=\"385\" y=\"96\">+</text><text x=\"385\" y=\"232\">−</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"96\">+</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"232\">−</text><text x=\"495\" y=\"96\">+</text><text x=\"495\" y=\"232\">−</text></g><g stroke=\"#d4a72c\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M275 100V215\"/><path d=\"M330 100V215\"/><path d=\"M385 100V215\"/><path d=\"M440 100V215\"/><path d=\"M495 100V215\"/></g><circle cx=\"385\" cy=\"158\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#facc15\" stroke=\"#a16207\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M385 146V118M385 170V198\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M378 126l7-12 7 12M378 190l7 12 7-12\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><path d=\"M620 150l15 8-15 8\" fill=\"#334155\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"151\" font-size=\"13\">Source</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"13\">Slit</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\">B into the page</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"13\">Motion of particles un-deflected</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"14\">Velocity selector</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\">F_E</text><text x=\"367\" y=\"193\" font-size=\"12\">F_B</text></svg>",
