    "content": "<p>A. CURRENT MEASUREMENT</p><p>To measure current, the selector switch is turned to measure ampere and the proper scale is selected. This circuit contains resistors R₁, R₂, … of various resistances connected in parallel across the galvanometer, as shown in Figure 13.29. These resistances are collectively called a universal shunt. Any one shunt can be used to measure current in different ranges without making excessive current flow through the galvanometer.</p><p>FIGURE 13.29 — AVO meter switch turned to current measurement.</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AVO meter selector circuit for current measurement.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:720px;height:auto\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"180\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"105\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"155\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"205\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"255\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"305\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#111827\"/><path d=\"M170 180L237 155\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><path d=\"M245 105H500M245 155H500M245 205H500M245 255H500\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M370 105l15-9 15 18 15-18 15 18 15-9H500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"97\">R1</text><path d=\"M370 155l15-9 15 18 15-18 15 18 15-9H500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"147\">R2</text><path d=\"M370 205l15-9 15 18 15-18 15 18 15-9H500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"197\">R3</text><path d=\"M370 255l15-9 15 18 15-18 15 18 15-9H500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"247\">R4</text><path d=\"M500 105V255M120 180H170M120 180V330H500V255\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"170\">I</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"75\">Range selector</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"340\">off</text><text x=\"510\" y=\"180\">Lead</text></svg>",
