        "english": "EXAMPLE 14.2 — GIVEN: When the plane of the coil is perpendicular to the field, θ = 0°. When the coil is turned through 180°, θ = 180°. Initial flux linked with the coil: Φ₁ = NBA cos θ = NBA. Flux linked when turned through 180°: Φ₂ = −NBA. Change in flux: ΔΦ = Φ₂ − Φ₁ = (−NBA) − (NBA) = −2NBA.",
