        "text": "(c) Electrical power generated is P₁ = IV = 0.8 A × 0.08 V = 0.064 W. The magnetic force on the current-carrying loop of length ℓ is F = B I ℓ = 2 T × 0.8 A × 0.2 m = 0.32 N.",
        "english": "(c) Electrical power generated is P₁ = IV = 0.8 A × 0.08 V = 0.064 W. The magnetic force on the current-carrying loop of length ℓ is F = B I ℓ = 2 T × 0.8 A × 0.2 m = 0.32 N.",
        "urdu": "(ج) پیدا ہونے والی برقی طاقت P₁ = IV = 0.8 A × 0.08 V = 0.064 W ہے۔ لمبائی ℓ کے کرنٹ بردار حلقے پر مقناطیسی قوت F = B I ℓ = 2 T × 0.8 A × 0.2 m = 0.32 N ہے۔",
        "pashto": "(ج) تولید شوی برېښنايي توان P₁ = IV = 0.8 A × 0.08 V = 0.064 W دی. د ℓ اوږدوالي جریان‌لرونکي کړۍ مقناطیسي قوه F = B I ℓ = 2 T × 0.8 A × 0.2 m = 0.32 N ده.",
        "originalText": "(c) Electrical power generated is P₁ = IV = 0.8 A × 0.08 V = 0.064 W. The magnetic force on the current-carrying loop of length ℓ is F = B I ℓ = 2 T × 0.8 A × 0.2 m = 0.32 N.",
        "originalLanguage": "en"
