        "english": "EXAMPLE 14.4 — An A.C. motor has internal resistance 4 Ω. On a 50 Hz A.C. supply with peak voltage 120 V, it draws peak current 5 A. Find (1) peak back e.m.f., (2) peak power delivered by the A.C. supply, and (3) peak rate of energy loss as heat in the motor.",
