        "english": "GIVEN — Rₐ = 4 Ω; f = 50 Hz; peak current Iₐ = 5 A; peak applied voltage V = 120 V. REQUIRED — peak back e.m.f. ε; peak power Ppeak; peak heat-loss rate Pheat.",
