        "english": "CONCEPTUAL QUESTIONS (continued) — 9. What is meant by the term back e.m.f. in operation of an electric motor? 10. Why is it advantageous for the armature to rotate in a radial magnetic field rather than a uniform field? TRANSFORMER CORE: (a) Which material would you prefer: iron, solid soft iron, laminated soft iron or aluminium? (b) Why is this material used?",
