    "id": "phys17-exercise-mcq9-12-conceptual-comprehensive-and-numerical-252-253",
    "title": "Unit 17 remaining MCQs, conceptual and comprehensive questions, numerical problems 1–5",
    "kind": "lesson",
    "pdfPage": 132,
