        "originalText": "COMPREHENSIVE QUESTIONS (1–8). 1. Describe energy-band structure of insulators, semiconductors and conductors. 2. Explain the significance of the depletion layer at equilibrium in a PN junction and give an energy-band diagram. 3. Explain how a PN junction acts as a half-wave rectifier. 4. Explain transistor operation as an amplifier. 5. Draw half-wave and full-wave rectifier circuits. 6. Compare advantages and disadvantages of full-wave and half-wave rectifiers. 7. Derive the relation between α and β of a transistor. 8. Discuss extrinsic-semiconductor conductivity and its band-gap energy.",
