      "FREQUENCY — The number of cycles per second is frequency f, measured in cycles per second or hertz (Hz). Pakistan’s power-system frequency is 50 Hz, meaning alternating voltage or current completes 50 cycles each second.",
      "INSTANTANEOUS VALUE — The value of an alternating quantity at any instant is its instantaneous value. Instantaneous alternating voltage and current are represented by V and I, respectively.",
