      "COMPREHENSIVE QUESTIONS (4–9). 4. Explain impedance in an A.C. circuit and derive its expression for an RLC series circuit. 5. Describe maximum power transfer when source and load impedances are matched. 6. In an R–L series circuit, does current lag or lead applied voltage? Explain with a phasor diagram. 7. In an R–C series circuit, does current lag or lead applied voltage? Explain with a phasor diagram. 8. State the four Maxwell equations; using Maxwell’s theory show E=(1/2πr)(ΔΦ/Δt)=AΔB/(2πrΔt) and I=ε₀ΔΦ/Δt. 9. Describe the principle of metal detectors with a suitable diagram.",
