        "text": "FIGURE 15.8 — A.C. source and resistor circuit; voltage and current waveforms and phasors are in phase.",
        "english": "FIGURE 15.8 — A.C. source and resistor circuit; voltage and current waveforms and phasors are in phase.",
        "urdu": "شکل 15.8 — اے سی منبع اور مزاحمت کا سرکٹ؛ وولٹیج اور رو کی موجیں اور فیزر ہم فیز ہیں۔",
        "pashto": "15.8 شکل — د A.C. سرچینې او مقاومت مدار؛ د ولتاژ او جریان څپې او فېزرونه هم‌پړاوي دي.",
        "originalText": "FIGURE 15.8 — A.C. source and resistor circuit; voltage and current waveforms and phasors are in phase.",
        "originalLanguage": "en"
