    "diagramSvgUrdu": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Population inversion and laser pumping energy levels with a long-lived metastable state, plus helium-neon active medium\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:660px;height:auto\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#fff\"/><path d=\"M75 130H295M75 260H295M390 130H600M390 260H600M75 370H295M390 370H600\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M125 360V130M210 360V130\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#a)\"/><path d=\"M430 130V260M510 130V260\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#b)\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"465\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"535\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"570\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><defs><marker id=\"a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L0 6L6 3z\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/></marker><marker id=\"b\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L0 6L6 3z\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"60\">عام حالت: بنیادی آبادی زیادہ</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"60\">آبادی الٹ پھیر: نیم مستحکم سطح پر زیادہ ایٹم</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"115\">پمپ ایٹم اوپر اٹھاتا ہے</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"115\">کم عمر E₃</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"245\">طویل عمر نیم مستحکم E₂</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"345\">تقریباً 10⁻⁸ s بعد: E₃→E₂</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"345\">E₂ سے لیزر منتقلی</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"430\">He 85% → Ne 15% فعال وسط</text></svg>",
    "diagramSvgPashto": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Population inversion and laser pumping energy levels with a long-lived metastable state, plus helium-neon active medium\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:660px;height:auto\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#fff\"/><path d=\"M75 130H295M75 260H295M390 130H600M390 260H600M75 370H295M390 370H600\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M125 360V130M210 360V130\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#a)\"/><path d=\"M430 130V260M510 130V260\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"4\" marker-end=\"url(#b)\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"465\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"535\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><circle cx=\"570\" cy=\"260\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><defs><marker id=\"a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L0 6L6 3z\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/></marker><marker id=\"b\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L0 6L6 3z\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"60\">عادي حالت: بنسټیزه کچه کې ډېر اتومونه</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"60\">نفوسي سرچپه‌والی: نیمه‌ثابت کچه کې ډېر اتومونه</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"115\">پمپ اتومونه پورته وړي</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"115\">لنډمهالی E₃</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"245\">اوږدمهالی نیمه‌ثابت E₂</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"345\">شاوخوا 10⁻⁸ s وروسته: E₃→E₂</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"345\">له E₂ څخه لېزري لېږد</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"430\">He 85% → Ne 15% فعال منځنی</text></svg>"
