        "text": "Beginning in about 1945, many new particles were discovered in experiments involving high-energy collisions between known particles. Such particles are highly unstable and have very short half-lives, ranging between \\(10^{6}\\) and \\(10^{23}\\ \\mathrm{s}\\). So far, more than 400 of these unstable, temporary particles have been catalogued.",
