        "english": "Similarly if \\(\\hat r_{21}\\) is unit vector, pointing from the charge \\(q_2\\) towards the charge \\(q_1\\), then the force exerted by the charge \\(q_2\\) on \\(q_1\\) in vector form is:",
        "urdu": "اسی طرح اگر \\(\\hat r_{21}\\) بار \\(q_2\\) سے \\(q_1\\) کی طرف اکائی سمتیہ ہو تو \\(q_2\\) کی جانب سے \\(q_1\\) پر قوت کی سمتی صورت یہ ہے:",
        "pashto": "همدارنګه که \\(\\hat r_{21}\\) له \\(q_2\\) څخه \\(q_1\\) ته واحد ویکټور وي، نو پر \\(q_1\\) د \\(q_2\\) د قوې ویکټوري بڼه دا ده:",
        "originalText": "Similarly if \\(\\hat r_{21}\\) is unit vector, pointing from the charge \\(q_2\\) towards the charge \\(q_1\\), then the force exerted by the charge \\(q_2\\) on \\(q_1\\) in vector form is:",
        "originalLanguage": "en"
