        "pashto": "د برېښنايي میدان شدت \\(\\vec E=\\frac{\\vec F}{q_0}\\)",
        "originalText": "The electric field intensity \\(\\vec E=\\frac{\\vec F}{q_0}\\)",
        "originalLanguage": "en"
