    "id": "phys12-front-aircraft22",
    "title": "FOR YOUR INFORMATION",
    "kind": "lesson",
    "content": "<p>FOR YOUR INFORMATION</p><p>Airlines Airbus A380 flew through a storm when 500 peoples were on the board but none of them were injured. As there is no electric field, no potential difference inside a metal shell, so one of the safest way to be inside a metal shell during thunderstorm.</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Coded schematic airliner in a lightning storm illustrating the source metal-shell discussion\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:440px\"><rect width=\"440\" height=\"240\" fill=\"#334155\"/><path d=\"M15 25L135 40 182 94 230 20 319 31 352 90M230 20L216 60 254 100 239 150M352 90L325 114 358 175\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fef08a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><g transform=\"rotate(-12 220 150)\"><path d=\"M50 149Q108 126 331 140L383 151Q365 165 86 166Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#111827\"/><path d=\"M195 144L257 86H285L249 149M182 158L266 205H302L237 159M93 146L69 106H95L134 146\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#111827\"/><path d=\"M120 142H319M120 151H319\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 4\"/><circle cx=\"232\" cy=\"179\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" stroke=\"#111827\"/><circle cx=\"262\" cy=\"129\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" stroke=\"#111827\"/></g></svg></figure>",
    "theory": "FOR YOUR INFORMATION\nAirlines Airbus A380 flew through a storm when 500 peoples were on the board but none of them were injured. As there is no electric field, no potential difference inside a metal shell, so one of the safest way to be inside a metal shell during thunderstorm.",
