    "kind": "lesson",
    "content": "<p>PARALLEL COMBINATION OF CAPACITORS</p><p>When the battery is connected to the parallel plates of a capacitor as shown in Figure 11.25. The equivalent capacitance Ce of this combination is given by</p><p>\\(C_e=C_1+C_2+C_3\\) ...(11.35)</p><p>[Editorial clarification: the source caption under Figure 11.25 reads “Series combination of capacitors,” although the diagram and heading show a parallel combination. The printed caption is preserved.]</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 255\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three capacitors connected in parallel between A and B across battery V; source caption says series\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:360px\"><path d=\"M35 60H330M35 190H330M35 60V190M330 60V190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M164 195V230M184 207V219\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"230\">V</text><path d=\"M87 60V100M103 60V100M87 150V190M103 150V190\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M85 100H105V150H85Z\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><path d=\"M95 65V96M95 154V186\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\"/><path d=\"M95 96L92.0 89.0L98.0 89.0Z\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><path d=\"M95 154L92.0 147.0L98.0 147.0Z\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"82\" y=\"126\">C₁</text><path d=\"M177 60V100M193 60V100M177 150V190M193 150V190\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M175 100H195V150H175Z\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><path d=\"M185 65V96M185 154V186\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\"/><path d=\"M185 96L182.0 89.0L188.0 89.0Z\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><path d=\"M185 154L182.0 147.0L188.0 147.0Z\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"172\" y=\"126\">C₂</text><path d=\"M267 60V100M283 60V100M267 150V190M283 150V190\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M265 100H285V150H265Z\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><path d=\"M275 65V96M275 154V186\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\"/><path d=\"M275 96L272.0 89.0L278.0 89.0Z\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><path d=\"M275 154L272.0 147.0L278.0 147.0Z\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"126\">C₃</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"52\">A</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"52\">B</text></svg><figcaption>FIGURE 11.25: Series combination of capacitors (source caption)</figcaption></figure>",
